Actually, let me reconsider. The most standard, non-invented approach is querying by text. For presencas/encontros I can assert text "2/2" or "2 de 2"? That would invent layout. To avoid this, I'll assert the container textContent contains the values. I think combining:
- findByText(/SA26-7K2M-9QXA/)
- getByText(/360/) 
- container textContent includes '360' and '2' etc.

